{"seq":1,"slug":"special-relativity","title":"狭义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/special-relativity","wordCount":1525,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"狭义相对论\">狭义相对论</h1><p>1905 年 6 月 30 日，《物理年鉴》收到一篇题为《论动体的电动力学》（Zur Elektrodynamik bewegter Körper）的论文。它没有一条参考文献，开头平静地讨论一根磁铁和一个线圈的相对运动，结尾却彻底改写了人类对时间和空间的理解。这就是狭义相对论的诞生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>狭义相对论建立在两条简洁的公设之上，由此推导出一整套关于运动、时间与空间的结论。它的逻辑结构可以表示如下。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[相对性原理: 物理定律在一切惯性系中相同] --&gt; C[狭义相对论]&#10;    B[光速不变原理: 真空光速 c 对所有惯性观察者相同] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[同时性的相对性]&#10;    C --&gt; E[时间膨胀: 运动的钟变慢]&#10;    C --&gt; F[长度收缩: 运动的尺变短]&#10;    C --&gt; G[速度叠加的修正]&#10;    C --&gt; H[质能等价 E=mc^2]\">flowchart TD\n    A[相对性原理: 物理定律在一切惯性系中相同] --&gt; C[狭义相对论]\n    B[光速不变原理: 真空光速 c 对所有惯性观察者相同] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[同时性的相对性]\n    C --&gt; E[时间膨胀: 运动的钟变慢]\n    C --&gt; F[长度收缩: 运动的尺变短]\n    C --&gt; G[速度叠加的修正]\n    C --&gt; H[质能等价 E=mc^2]</pre><p>与它取代的牛顿绝对时空观相比，差异集中体现在下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>牛顿力学</th>\n<th>狭义相对论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>绝对，对所有观察者一致</td>\n<td>相对，取决于观察者运动状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>绝对，长度不变</td>\n<td>长度沿运动方向收缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同时性</td>\n<td>绝对</td>\n<td>相对，取决于参考系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度叠加</td>\n<td>简单相加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u&#x27; = u + v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>受光速限制的非线性叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光速</td>\n<td>依赖于光源与观察者运动</td>\n<td>恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，与运动无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极限速度</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>真空光速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"历史背景-以太与迈克尔逊-莫雷实验\">历史背景：以太与迈克尔逊-莫雷实验</h2><p>十九世纪的物理学家相信，光像声波需要空气一样，需要一种叫&quot;以太&quot;的介质来传播。如果以太充满宇宙且静止，那么地球绕日运动时应当&quot;穿过&quot;以太，产生可测量的&quot;以太风&quot;。</p>\n<p>1887 年，迈克尔逊（Albert Michelson）和莫雷（Edward Morley）用极为精密的干涉仪试图测出这股以太风，结果却是零——无论地球朝哪个方向运动，光速都没有变化。这一&quot;零结果&quot;成了经典物理学头顶的乌云。</p>\n<p>许多人尝试修补，洛伦兹（Hendrik Lorentz）提出运动物体会沿运动方向收缩，并写下了著名的&quot;洛伦兹变换&quot;。但他仍把这些当作以太中的真实力学效应。爱因斯坦的突破在于：他干脆抛弃以太，把光速不变当作基本公设，让时间和空间本身成为相对的量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条公设与时间膨胀\">两条公设与时间膨胀</h2><p>狭义相对论只需两条假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相对性原理</strong>：一切物理定律在所有惯性参考系中形式相同，不存在&quot;绝对静止&quot;的参考系。</li>\n<li><strong>光速不变原理</strong>：真空中的光速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 对所有惯性观察者都相同，与光源或观察者的运动无关。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>从这两条出发，时间膨胀自然浮现。设一个参考系相对观察者以速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 运动，定义洛伦兹因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\dfrac{v^2}{c^2}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6514em;vertical-align:-2.33em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6876em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6876em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6476em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7524em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9176em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6876em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3646em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6876em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.33em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>运动时钟测得的固有时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与静止观察者测得的时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 之间满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = \\gamma \\, \\Delta t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，运动的钟总是走得更慢。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，相对论效应可忽略，这正是日常生活感受不到它的原因。只有接近光速时，效应才显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长度收缩与同时性的相对性\">长度收缩与同时性的相对性</h2><p>时间被改写，空间也不能幸免。沿运动方向，物体的长度会收缩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>γ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\frac{L_0}{\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是物体在自身静止参考系中的固有长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是运动参考系中测得的长度。注意收缩只发生在运动方向上，垂直方向不变。</p>\n<p>更违反直觉的是同时性的相对性。在一个参考系中&quot;同时&quot;发生的两件事，在另一个相对运动的参考系中可能并不同时。爱因斯坦用一列火车的思想实验说明：站台上的人看到车厢两端的闪电同时击中，而车厢中央的乘客由于朝其中一道闪电运动，会先看到它——两人对&quot;同时&quot;的判断不同，且都正确。同时性不再是绝对的客观事实，而依赖于观察者的运动状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验验证与现代应用\">实验验证与现代应用</h2><p>狭义相对论并非纸上空谈，它在二十世纪被反复检验，精度极高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>μ 子衰变</td>\n<td>高速宇宙射线 μ 子寿命延长，得以抵达地面</td>\n<td>直接证实时间膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>飞行原子钟</td>\n<td>1971 年哈费勒-基廷实验，环球飞行的原子钟与地面钟读数出现可测差异</td>\n<td>宏观尺度验证时间膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒子加速器</td>\n<td>接近光速的粒子寿命延长、能量随速度增加</td>\n<td>日常验证相对论动力学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPS 卫星</td>\n<td>卫星钟需同时修正狭义与广义相对论效应</td>\n<td>不修正则定位每天偏差约 10 公里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 GPS 是最贴近生活的例子：卫星高速运动会让其原子钟变慢（狭义相对论效应），若不加以修正，导航系统几小时内就会失准。可以说，每一次手机定位都在默默检验着 1905 年那篇论文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>狭义相对论发表于 1905 年，论文《论动体的电动力学》仅凭两条公设重建了时空观。</li>\n<li>两条公设是相对性原理与光速不变原理，迈克尔逊-莫雷实验的零结果是其历史背景。</li>\n<li>核心结论包括时间膨胀、长度收缩、同时性的相对性，均由洛伦兹因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画。</li>\n<li>理论在 μ 子衰变、原子钟实验、粒子加速器和 GPS 中被高精度验证。</li>\n<li>它取代了牛顿绝对时空观，但在低速下退化为牛顿力学，二者并不冲突。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"general-relativity\">广义相对论</a>：狭义理论容不下引力的缺口，爱因斯坦用八年把它补上，引力从此成为时空弯曲。</li>\n<li><a href=\"mass-energy-equivalence\">质能等价 E=mc²</a>：本理论的直接推论——同年 9 月那篇三页论文，写出了科学史上最著名的方程。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect\">光电效应</a>：同年 3 月投出的奇迹年首篇，爱因斯坦自认比相对论更&quot;革命&quot;的工作。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"狭义相对论","id":"狭义相对论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"历史背景：以太与迈克尔逊-莫雷实验","id":"历史背景-以太与迈克尔逊-莫雷实验"},{"level":2,"text":"两条公设与时间膨胀","id":"两条公设与时间膨胀"},{"level":2,"text":"长度收缩与同时性的相对性","id":"长度收缩与同时性的相对性"},{"level":2,"text":"实验验证与现代应用","id":"实验验证与现代应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"广义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/general-relativity"}}